attribution: Music by Walter Donaldson (died 1947), words by Gus Kahn (died 1941); written for the musical "Whoopee!" and published by Donaldson, Douglas & Gumble in 1928. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
